WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.234
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:05.167
You're here. You're watching.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.968
You made it.
Thank you very much.

00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:09.968
Let's get to some news.
Well, guys, last night

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.901
President Biden made
the big announcement

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:14.601
that the U.S. took out
the leader of al-Qaeda,

00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:17.868
Ayman al-Zawahiri,
with a drone strike. Watch this.

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:20.934
-We make it clear again tonight,
that no matter

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:24.400
how long it takes,
no matter where you hide,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.801
if you are a threat
to our people,

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:30.133
the United States will find you
and take you out.

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:32.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:35.200
-I'm pretty sure he's just
quoting Liam Neeson in "Taken,"

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.834
but it works.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:39.167
It works.
Whatever it was, it works.

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:40.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:43.801
That's right.
"We will find you."

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.167
Yeah, Biden took out
al-Zawahiri,

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.634
Obama took out bin Laden,

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.968
and Trump said, "Okay, who wants
to order take-out?"

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:54.734
[ Laughter ]
"I'm getting two buckets for me.

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:58.334
I'm getting the double bucket."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.200
Yeah, they took him out
with a drone.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.000
And if that didn't work, they
were just going to send him

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.601
an envelope that Biden licked.

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:08.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.634
That's right.
They got him with a drone.

00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:13.000
His last words were "Wait, did I
order same-day delivery?

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.734
What is --"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.100
Yeah, Biden's on quite a run.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.067
Last week the climate
and economy bill,

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:20.300
