takedown.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.834
Is it just me, or is COVID
really working for Biden?

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.734
Remember the 2020 election?

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:28.734
